      "leadSummary": "**Guiding question:** Which material and geometry parameters control supported modes, attenuation and practical optical interconnect reliability? Integrated photonics and fibers rely on modes rather than single rays. Geometry, refractive-index contrast and surface conditions jointly determine confinement and modal atte",
